      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMOKE 'N' DARTS (3) closed strongly to just get the prize when resuming over 1000m at this track two runs ago. Showed pace at Randwick subsequently but dropped right out at the end of 1200m. Freshened up and this is a far more suitable assignment. Can turn things around. PRESIDES (1) has tackled a couple of much stronger races than this since coming back from a break and hasn't been disgraced. Caught the eye late in the piece to be beaten three lengths last time out in the 1400m Gundagai Snake Gully Cup. Yet to miss the frame in seven runs at Kembla. Serious threat. ALL MACHIAVELLIAN (6) flew home to be beaten a whisker first-up over 1400m at the Grange circuit a fortnight ago. Veteran who can never be ruled out of a race like this. AGAINST THE LAW (5) was eased up last start so forget the run. Impressed here first-up.",
